{"id":"jsNumber","name":"JS: Number","description":"JavaScript API 词典","level":"代码练习","cover":"💻","category":"代码练习","language":"code","words":[{"id":"jsNumber_00001","word":"Number.EPSILON","phonetic":"","pos":"Number.","meaning":"Number.EPSILON 属性表示 1 和大于 1 的最小的浮点数（可表示为 Number）的差值。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"jsNumber"},{"id":"jsNumber_00002","word":"Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER","phonetic":"","pos":"Number.","meaning":"Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER 常量表示在 JavaScript 中最大的安全整数（maxinum safe integer)（253 - 1）。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"jsNumber"},{"id":"jsNumber_00003","word":"Number.MAX_VALUE","phonetic":"","pos":"Number.","meaning":"Number.MAX_VALUE 属性表示在 JavaScript 里所能表示的最大数值。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"jsNumber"},{"id":"jsNumber_00004","word":"Number.MIN_SAFE_INTEGER","phonetic":"","pos":"Number.","meaning":"Number.MIN_SAFE_INTEGER 代表在 JavaScript中最小的安全的integer型数字 (-(253 - 1)).","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"jsNumber"},{"id":"jsNumber_00005","word":"Number.MIN_VALUE","phonetic":"","pos":"Number.","meaning":"Number.MIN_VALUE 属性表示在 JavaScript 中所能表示的最小的正值。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"jsNumber"},{"id":"jsNumber_00006","word":"Number.NEGATIVE_INFINITY","phonetic":"","pos":"Number.","meaning":"Number.NEGATIVE_INFINITY 属性表示负无穷大。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"jsNumber"},{"id":"jsNumber_00007","word":"Number.NaN","phonetic":"","pos":"Number.","meaning":"Number.NaN 表示“非数字”（Not-A-Number）。和 NaN 相同。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"jsNumber"},{"id":"jsNumber_00008","word":"Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY","phonetic":"","pos":"Number.","meaning":"Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY 属性表示正无穷大。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"jsNumber"},{"id":"jsNumber_00009","word":"Number.isFinite()","phonetic":"","pos":"Number.","meaning":"Number.isFinite() 方法用来检测传入的参数是否是一个有穷数（finite number）。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"jsNumber"},{"id":"jsNumber_00010","word":"Number.isInteger()","phonetic":"","pos":"Number.","meaning":"Number.isInteger() 方法用来判断给定的参数是否为整数。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"jsNumber"},{"id":"jsNumber_00011","word":"Number.isNaN()","phonetic":"","pos":"Number.","meaning":"Number.isNaN() 方法确定传递的值是否为 NaN和其类型是 Number。它是原始的全局isNaN()的更强大的版本。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"jsNumber"},{"id":"jsNumber_00012","word":"Number.isSafeInteger()","phonetic":"","pos":"Number.","meaning":"Number.isSafeInteger() 方法用来判断传入的参数值是否是一个“安全整数”（safe integer）。一个安全整数是一个符合下面条件的整数：","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"jsNumber"},{"id":"jsNumber_00013","word":"Number.parseFloat()","phonetic":"","pos":"Number.","meaning":"Number.parseFloat() 方法可以把一个字符串解析成浮点数。该方法与全局的 parseFloat() 函数相同，并且处于 ECMAScript 6 规范中（用于全局变量的模块化）。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"jsNumber"},{"id":"jsNumber_00014","word":"Number.parseInt()","phonetic":"","pos":"Number.","meaning":"Number.parseInt() 方法可以根据给定的进制数把一个字符串解析成整数。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"jsNumber"},{"id":"jsNumber_00015","word":"toExponential()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"toExponential() 方法以指数表示法返回该数值字符串表示形式。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"jsNumber"},{"id":"jsNumber_00016","word":"toFixed()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"toFixed() 方法使用定点表示法来格式化一个数。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"jsNumber"},{"id":"jsNumber_00017","word":"toLocaleString()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"toLocaleString() 方法返回这个数字在特定语言环境下的表示字符串。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"jsNumber"},{"id":"jsNumber_00018","word":"toPrecision()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"toPrecision() 方法以指定的精度返回该数值对象的字符串表示。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"jsNumber"},{"id":"jsNumber_00019","word":"toSource()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"toSource() 方法返回该对象源码的字符串表示。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"jsNumber"},{"id":"jsNumber_00020","word":"toString()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"toString() 方法返回指定 Number 对象的字符串表示形式。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"jsNumber"},{"id":"jsNumber_00021","word":"valueOf()","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"valueOf() 方法返回一个被 Number 对象包装的原始值。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"jsNumber"},{"id":"jsNumber_00022","word":"Number.toInteger()","phonetic":"","pos":"Number.","meaning":"Number.toInteger() 用来将参数转换成整数,但该方法的实现已被移除.","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"jsNumber"}]}